=== prompt
For each of 3, 8 and 12, log whether it lies between 5 and 10 inclusive, as a Bool (`true` or `false`), one per line.
=== expected
false
true
false
=== reference
[3 8 12] = xs
0 | Var(i)
Repeat({
  xs | Take(i) = x
  All({x | IsMoreEqual(5)} {x | IsLessEqual(10)}) | Log
  Inc(i)
} times: 3)
